  "description": "Lee Ba-Da, a female protagonist who can see “the moment people fall in love” (Sappa-tam). While using her ability to help others find love, she ends up falling for Hyeon-Jae, her childhood friend of ten years. Because of her ability, she believes that love is merely a fleeting emotion caused by “Sappa-tam”…\n\nA coming-of-age romance about the protagonists navigating a storm of emotions, as they experience both heartbreak and healing.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
